{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"ALSA-2026:61377","published":"2026-08-31T00:00:00Z","modified":"2026-09-01T12:55:51.080175452Z","related":["CVE-2026-56846","CVE-2026-56848","CVE-2026-58043"],"summary":"Important: nodejs24 security, bug fix, and enhancement update","details":"Node.js is a platform built on Chrome's JavaScript runtime for easily building fast, scalable network applications. Node.js uses an event-driven, non-blocking I/O model that makes it lightweight and efficient, perfect for data-intensive real-time applications that run across distributed devices.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * nodejs: Node.js: Unauthorized filesystem access due to Permission Model enforcement flaw (CVE-2026-58043)\n  * nodejs: Node.js: Remote memory exhaustion via HTTP/2 retained header blocks (CVE-2026-56846)\n  * nodejs: Node.js: Heap-use-after-free in HTTP/2 handling can lead to denial of service (CVE-2026-56848)\n\n\nBug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):  \n\n  * nodejs24: Rebase to the latest Node.js 24 release [almalinux-10.2.z] (JIRA:AlmaLinux-220543)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"nodejs24","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:10","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/nodejs24"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1:24.19.0-1.el10_2"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux10/ALSA-2026:61377.json"}},{"package":{"name":"nodejs24-devel","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:10","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/nodejs24-devel"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1:24.19.0-1.el10_2"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux10/ALSA-2026:61377.json"}},{"package":{"name":"nodejs24-docs","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:10","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/nodejs24-docs"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1:24.19.0-1.el10_2"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux10/ALSA-2026:61377.json"}},{"package":{"name":"nodejs24-full-i18n","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:10","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/nodejs24-full-i18n"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1:24.19.0-1.el10_2"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux10/ALSA-2026:61377.json"}},{"package":{"name":"nodejs24-libs","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:10","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/nodejs24-libs"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1:24.19.0-1.el10_2"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux10/ALSA-2026:61377.json"}},{"package":{"name":"nodejs24-npm","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:10","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/nodejs24-npm"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1:11.17.0-1.24.19.0.1.el10_2"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux10/ALSA-2026:61377.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:61377"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-56846"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-56848"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-58043"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/2509171"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/2510856"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://errata.almalinux.org/10/ALSA-2026-61377.html"}]}